<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00294/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>Site-CN-██办公室中的一面墙，墙上贴有“成功的阶梯”贴纸，但是其中“成功”二字被倒置，且每个“阶梯”所代表的小人顺序也是颠倒的，其顺序从下往上为：【我做到了➡️我能做到➡️试着去做➡️该怎么做➡️我不想做➡️我才不做】所有视觉接触项目3秒及以上的人类个体都会对自己正在进行的事件或其他人类个体的命令产生强烈的抗拒，并在向他人拒绝时会说出：“我才不做！”且项目无法被任何物理手段撕下或破坏。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>连同整面墙一起被收容于低危异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>Dr.pigeon，你的报告写完没？没写完赶紧写。</em>——站点主管███<br />
<em>嘿，我才不做！</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00294" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00294" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00294-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607500669" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593705457 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Jul 2020 15:57</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607500669" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590676061 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 14:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块型号不明的手机电池，当所处空间温度超过30℃时，该项目会迅速膨胀到汽车安全气囊的大小。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site23东侧的手机修理店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存于Site23的低风险异常项目仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>“一名女士跟我说手机的安全气囊弹出来了，当时我还不信。”——潜伏于手机修理店的邢特工</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00278" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00278" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00278-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4136896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607500669" alt="Ginger249-Jackie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4136896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ginger249-jackie" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4136896); return false;">Ginger249-Jackie</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592710114 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">21 Jun 2020 03:28</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00195/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个旧陶瓷碗，当放置于地面时周围20m为半径的所有人均会掏出他们身上的所有硬币丢入碗内。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███市火车站<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存储于Site-CN-93的收容柜<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>小时候，我总希望自己能过上啥也不干也能拿钱的生活……现在看来，这不就是乞丐吗？——██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00195" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00195" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00195-hovertip">
